  "why": "A nuclear power plant on a plain lawn (no house): a cut-open plant hall holding an open-fronted reactor tank with big green fuel rods in blue water and the turbine generator, a cooling tower with a white plume outside, and a pylon carrying live power lines. The camera opens close on the rods in the tank, follows the steam pipe to the turbine, pulls out to the lines and the tower, and ends wide on the hall with the concrete dome over the reactor.",
